SUMMARY:Bingo Fundraiser: Supporting Mountain Pet Rescue
DESCRIPTION:There Was a Farmer Who Had a Dog…\nMountain Pet Rescue is hosting a game of Bingo at our place and you won’t want to miss out on all the fun! All ages bingo\, and you know we’re dog friendly so bring your fuzzy pals\, too! \nBingo cards are available for purchase in advance on Mountain Pet Rescue’s website. \n 
