SUMMARY:CHONKIT Party & Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of tiny treasures and big creativity!\n Play mini games and challenges\n Personalize your own set at the Chonkit Bar\n Craft pins\, bracelets\, and keychains\n Collect FREE limited-edition Chonkits\n\nWhether you’re a collector\, crafter\, gamer\, or just curious about Chonkits\, come make something fun and discover a whole world of tiny possibilities.\n\nBuild. Craft. Play. Collect.\n\nFREE to join • All ages welcome\n\n\n Learn More!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/chonkit-party-game-night/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Chonkit-Party-July-23-The-Mule.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=dc1d0f426e28a1fe8ed36aad3c670211
END:VEVENT
