SUMMARY:Feelin' Good & Foolin' Around: A Spotlight Film Night
DESCRIPTION: Lights\, laughter\, action!\nJoin AVL Film for Feelin’ Good & Foolin’ Around\, a one-of-a-kind night of comedy\, cinema\, and community at The Mule on Friday\, July 24. In partnership with Carrboro Film Fest\, this spirited evening features six standout short films from talented regional filmmakers\, plus live music\, improv by Dad Bod\, and an engaging Q&A with several of the filmmakers. Expect quirky comedies\, unexpected romances\, and stories that will have you laughing out loud\, feeling all the feels\, and celebrating the incredible creative talent of the Southeast. It’s the perfect summer night out for film lovers and anyone looking for a memorable Asheville experience. \n Grab Your Tickets Now!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/feelin-good-foolin-around-a-spotlight-film-night/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/July24_Cinema_IG.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=69a4abfc96317a641471852872bf26d0
END:VEVENT
