SUMMARY:Bacon\, Beer\, Blues\, Bourbon Fest
DESCRIPTION:Did Someone Say Free Bacon?!\nThat’s right! Cruise over to our place on Saturday July 25th and fill your belly with a delicious array of classic and flavored bacon. Our favorite NC craft beer and spirit makers will be here offering free samples to pair with the bites\, too! \nMr. Jimmy takes the stage bringing Chicago-style blues to Asheville.\nThe Beefie Boys food truck will be here serving up delicious beef sammies.\nAll in support of our friends at Appalachian Community Relief. 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/bacon-beer-blues-bourbon-fest/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!,Fundraiser,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Bacon-Beer-Bourbon-Fest-IG-copy.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=552ea8d45640133a7b6d8395ab53b2ec
END:VEVENT
