SUMMARY:Resister Drag Bingo Benefiting Campaign for Southern Equality
DESCRIPTION:ReSister Bingo is back!\nOur hostess Dahmit Janet returns to bring you the Reflecting Pool Edition of our ReSister Bingo at The Mule at Devil’s Foot Beverage!   Come in your pool party chic – or your best algae green swamp dwelling best for the costume contest! \nJoining Janet will be the incredible Madisin Rose – her siren songs will have you enthralled! This time we are raising for Campaign for Southern Equality – and all the great work they do! \nSo\, come on out to the Mule\, help raise some money for a great cause\, AND have a great time doing it! \nSee you there! \nEntry is $20 cash or $23 zelle at the door. No advance payments accepted or required.\n\n\n Learn more about Campaign for Southern Equality!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/resister-drag-bingo-benefiting-campaign-for-southern-equality/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/07.25.26-Bingo-Flyer-1.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=ed706ab273e1d0b6c27b040c26e9c70c
END:VEVENT
