LAST-MODIFIED:20260707T181900Z
UID:10001378-1785070800-1785081600@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:Brunchapalooza!: Vamos a La Playa
DESCRIPTION:Vamos a La Playa\nJuly’s Brunchapalooza is hot hot hot! DJ ONEIRIC bringin’ the Miami vibes with Latin-influenced tropical dance music. We’ll have some kiddie pools out in the yard to cool off those dancing feet. Wear your hottest Neon and come ready to dance\, drink and shop some local vendors! \nThis month’s event supports Unete\, promoting wellness for the whole person and the whole community. \nBrunch. But Better.\nSundays are for brunch. And Brunchapalooza takes it to the next level with live entertainment\, rotating themes and cuisines and your last chance to do it big before Monday. Each month we’ll be throwing on different costumes\, serving up fresh bevs\, supporting a different non-profit\, and devouring the rotating menu at the Let’s Cook food truck! And that’s not all\, if you know us you know we’ve got more in store\, but you’ll just have to come see for yourself. \nSo get hungry\, stay tuned\, and we’ll see you on Sunday. \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/brunchapalooza-4/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-July-Brunch-.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=ad599ab1275726de8edb689aca752999
END:VEVENT
